    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"/>
        <IRI>#sedimentary_rock</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="pt-br">Rocha que é gerada por um Processo Geológico de sedimentação, envolvendo a deposição e a cimentação de partículas minerais ou orgânicas na superfície ou próximo à superfície da Terra.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"/>
        <IRI>#sedimentary_rock</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">Rock that is generated by a Geological Process of sedimentation, involving the deposition and cementation of mineral or organic particles on or near the Earth&apos;s surface.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>#shale</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">Reference:
L. B. Magoon, W. G. Dow, The petroleum system, in: L. B. Magoon, W. G. Dow (Eds.), The Petroleum System: From Source to Trap, volume 60 of AAPG Memoir, American Association of Petroleum Geologists, Tulsa, Oklahoma, 1994, pp. 3–24.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel"/>
        <IRI>#shale</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="pt-br">folhelho</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel"/>
        <IRI>#shale</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">shalee</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"/>
        <IRI>#shale</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="pt-br">Folhelho é uma rocha sedimentar fina, laminada, composta por partículas de tamanho argila e silte, rica em matéria orgânica.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"/>
        <IRI>#shale</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">Shale is a fine-grained, laminated sedimentary rock composed of clay- and silt-sized particles and enriched in organic matter.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>#shale_layer</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">Reference:
L. B. Magoon, W. G. Dow, The petroleum system, in: L. B. Magoon, W. G. Dow (Eds.), The Petroleum System: From Source to Trap, volume 60 of AAPG Memoir, American Association of Petroleum Geologists, Tulsa, Oklahoma, 1994, pp. 3–24.</Literal>
