L. B. Magoon, W. G. Dow, The petroleum system, in: L. B. Magoon, W. G. Dow (Eds.), The Petroleum System: From Source to Trap, volume 60 of AAPG Memoir, American Association of Petroleum Geologists, Tulsa, Oklahoma, 1994, pp. 3–24.</Literal>
